o the rollback and open the SEV2 incident for that service, or one per service if it's both. Both targets were healthy in production before, so no change-manager approval is needed. There are no open incidents yet, so this won't duplicate a page.", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 170891, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 147906, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 170891, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 174909, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01EPua7sBK4Le53iB2qHQc9k", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 178909, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01EPua7sBK4Le53iB2qHQc9k", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 178909, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EPua7sBK4Le53iB2qHQc9k", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 178909, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MyL1CzqZMdB7v8g41RvsvK", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker v3.4.0 errors after deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "This morning's payments-worker v3.4.0 deploy is unhealthy, with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. payments-api (v5.1.0) is also degraded at 18%, which is believed to be downstream of the worker. Rolling payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last healthy production release. Watch payments-api recovery after the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 179509, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MyL1CzqZMdB7v8g41RvsvK", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 179509, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MyL1CzqZMdB7v8g41RvsvK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 181578, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01K5kpWgQmhsiX4CC2BARizr", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 181878, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01K5kpWgQmhsiX4CC2BARizr", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 181878, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01K5kpWgQmhsiX4CC2BARizr", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 181878, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NJniMQR7Ax4MaGibz3urqo", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 182178, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NJniMQR7Ax4MaGibz3urqo", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 182178, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NJniMQR7Ax4MaGibz3urqo", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 187400, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0 and opened the SEV2 incident. The worker has recovered, but payments-api is still failing.\n\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker is back on v3.3.0, its last release that was healthy in production. That's done in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%, and it now shows as healthy.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 against payments-worker, and on-call has been paged. The summary notes the effect on payments-api.\n- **payments-api:** it's still on v5.1.0 and its error rate is still 18%. It may just not have caught up yet, but the unchanged rate could also mean v5.1.0 has its own problem, separate from the worker.\n\nI left payments-api alone since you said its errors come from the worker. Give it a few minutes. If its error rate doesn't come down, I'd suggest rolling it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release; just tell me to go ahead. If that happens, I'll also add payments-api to INC-0001.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01HAM3BQ5bfz8NGbWBkZCemY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MgbFk55bpN8CDXSUWaUrR6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013YWthCpDBhEr1hMHAE7q9C", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019chLG1RE2bT9hKWC16FpC7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MU4u4zn6N7gn9PhNedzTH5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "ty